/T (Your liver deals with used estrogen by tagging it, which switches it off and marks it for disposal through the bile and out. That is the exit route.)
/E (Your liver deals with used estrogen by tagging it, which switches it off and marks it for disposal through the bile and out. That is the exit route.)
/Pg 17 0 R
